Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Build the CapDL initialiser against deps/rust-sel4

rust-sel4 needs a local patch (extra bootinfo offset for multi-page
bootinfo), so take it by path from the pinned checkout next to this
one instead of by git rev. The lock file only loses the git source of
the 30 rust-sel4 crates; no versions change.
---
 Cargo.lock | 30 ------------------------------
 Cargo.toml |  6 ++----
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

